      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Senky said he has already implemented code as of VRCFury v1.1002.0 that will auto-convert Unity Constraints to VRC Constraints, including animation paths, regardless if they've been already auto-converted or not through the SDK.\n\nHowever, SDK 3.7.0 will first need to exit the `-beta` version and become public. It's coded to only work with the non-beta SDK version.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "66bf225e567f83c8082076b2",
      "aiGenerated": false,
      "author": {
        "_id": "65f4b1a3d0a7a0c657a7d3a8",
        "alias": "Deliberate Salamander",
